    {
      "text": "Cracked after 5 months This product broke after five months of light use. The case broke and chipped at the corners leaving sharp edges that snagged clothing and left the iPad exposed. This case did not stand up to Specks standard quality and it was tossed and traded for an Otter Box. Bummer, because in the past, Speck has made great iPad cases.",
